      "widgets_values": [
        "Restore this exact Fallout 1 Colt 6520 10mm pistol inventory icon as one detailed prerendered 2D game asset. Preserve the original unusual retro-futuristic firearm design, silhouette, projection, position and framing exactly. The short heavy barrel and circular muzzle face point to the upper right; the vertical dark grip is at the lower left. Keep the stepped angular upper receiver, distinctive front barrel housing, trigger opening, and the original brown ribbed horizontal lower component. Use restrained worn dark gunmetal, subtle steel edge highlights and muted brown grip material. Remove pixel dithering and reveal coherent small mechanical details without changing the geometry. Preserve the late-1990s Fallout inventory lighting and muted colours. Do not replace it with a Glock, revolver, modern pistol or another gun design. Do not extend the barrel, add a scope, extra barrels, attachments, text, symbols or new parts. Keep the existing empty margins transparent. One item only, no hand, background, pedestal, scene or cast shadow. Keep all gun pixels within the original item area and preserve clear alpha in the trigger opening.",
        "",
        0
      ]
    },
